<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_legendarygem_05.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Celestial Dungeon Gear for Protection Warrior</span></h2>This list represents the best gear available strictly from Celestial dungeons &amp; August Stone Fragments in Phase 3 of Mists of Pandaria Classic, although it is very important to remember that because other gear may be obtained at a higher item level from raids, crafting, World Bosses, etc., it is not a true "best in slot" list but more of a rough guideline, and players should sim the gear they actually have available to them in order to determine their best combination of stats and effects.<br/>
